# MP-01 - End-to-end successful checkout

## Priority
High

## Type
Positive

## Steps

1. Open the application at https://www.saucedemo.com
2. On the login page enter username 'standard_user' and password 'secret_sauce'
3. Click 'Login' and verify the inventory page is displayed
4. On the inventory page find product 'Sauce Labs Backpack' and click 'Add to cart'
5. Click the cart icon in the header to open the cart
6. Verify the selected product is listed in the cart and click 'Checkout'
7. On the Checkout: Your Information page enter first name 'John', last name 'Doe', postal code '12345'
8. Click 'Continue' to go to the Overview page
9. On the Overview page verify the item, quantity, item total and tax are displayed correctly
10. Click 'Finish' to complete the order
11. Verify the completion/confirmation page is displayed with the message 'THANK YOU FOR YOUR ORDER' (or equivalent confirmation) and that checkout flow is finished

## Expected Result

User is able to complete full purchase flow: login, add a product, open cart, checkout and finish order. Order confirmation page is shown with confirmation message and the purchased item is recorded on the Overview prior to finishing.
